      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DON HUNTER (3) is a promising colt who scored a commanding win when resuming in a heat of this series, taking his unbeaten record at this circuit and distance to four. Has won a trial since so should have come on and the good draw gives him every chance to keep that perfect record intact. OH ITS ON (8) made a mess of the start then raced very wide last start so forget that result. Had been going very well prior, coming from this barrier for second to DON HUNTER two back and winning two in a row prior. Give him another chance. TRI TIME (6) is a lightly-raced but progressive colt who won his first two starts before coming from the back row for second last time. Could take this next step. TUAPEKA GOLD (7) led from a similar barrier for an easy win by 14 metres at this circuit and distance last week. Won his only previous third-up attempt so is open to further improvement. ROGUE BANDIT (4) is honest and draws much better than last start so could be competitive.",
